{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110815","id":2853277235,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6qEY4z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110815","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110815.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110815.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110815","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110815/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110815/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110815/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f8d72ba78345eadbe5cbb152832cbf7d7c2bfb30","number":110815,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Navigation 2D] Fix sign of cross product","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Regression from splitting the servers. The original code effectively took the cross product using `Vector3(v0.x, 0, v0.y).cross(Vector3(v1.x, 0, v1.y)).y`, but this is not equivalent to the 2D cross product which is equivalent to `Vector3(v0.x, v0.y, 0).cross(v1.x, v1.y, 0).z`.\r\n\r\nThe former gives `v1.x * v0.y - v0.x * v1.y`, but the latter gives `v0.x * v1.y - v1.x * v0.y`.\r\n\r\nFixed by negating the result in all places, verified against that the original 3D code is the plain cross product.\r\n\r\nAlso replaced the area formula, using `abs` instead which was an oversight in the original code.\r\n\r\n\r\nAdded minimal tests for the area formula and also for the closest point method, the latter can be removed if not necessary but wanted to make sure the area formula is correct, verified the area with conventional methods.\r\n\r\nMinimal project from smix8 (note that due to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110807 you will need to open the main scene manually, as saving the main scene currently breaks things):\r\n[godot-4.5-path-corridorfunnel-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22496855/godot-4.5-path-corridorfunnel-bug.zip)\r\n\r\nClick in the red circle to confirm that the path no longer goes the wrong way\r\n\r\nRelated (but does not fix the entire issue):\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110686\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04